## Post-cast ATB of the caster (not in `func_CastSpell`)

CombatUnit vtable slot `+0x224` (`on_spell_cast`) pays the mana cost and sets post-cast ATB.

| Side | Impl | Behaviour |
|---|---|---|
| Hero | `0x00BBF610` `func_CombatHero_GetStatStub224` (misleading Ghidra name) | ATB = 0.5 for mass spells, else based on mastery; artifact-set, perk `0xA2` and default-stats adjustments; applied via `set_atb` (`+0x18C`) |
| Creature | `0x008A11C0` `func_CombatCreature_GetStatStub224` | Fails if current mana (`+0x234`) minus `func_ComputeUnitManaCost` is negative; otherwise writes the new mana via `+0x22C` and sets ATB via `+0x18C` |

